# 9. BOOKING → VEHICLE STATUS MAPPING

Implement the following business rules.

## Customer creates booking

```text
Booking.status = PENDING
Vehicle.status = BOOKED
```

The vehicle must immediately disappear from Browse Vehicles.

This must happen atomically.

---

## Owner accepts booking

Owner is the ONLY role allowed to accept/reject a booking.

Owner acceptance is a **business decision**, but it does NOT itself make the booking `CONFIRMED`.

After Owner accepts:

```text
Booking.status = PENDING
Vehicle.status = BOOKED
```

Do NOT change the booking to `CONFIRMED` merely because the Owner accepted it.

Do NOT release the vehicle.

The booking becomes:

```text
CONFIRMED
```

only after the required driver assignment is completed, except for the valid approved owner-as-driver case.

Therefore the flow is exactly:

```text
Customer creates booking
        ↓
Booking = PENDING
Vehicle = BOOKED
        ↓
Owner accepts
        ↓
Booking remains PENDING
Vehicle remains BOOKED
        ↓
Driver assignment
        ↓
CONFIRMED
```

If owner-as-driver is valid according to the existing SRS:

```text
Owner accepts
        ↓
Approved owner-as-driver condition is verified
        ↓
CONFIRMED
```

Do not interpret Owner acceptance as confirmation.

