# 32. STATE SYNCHRONIZATION RULES

Use these relationships consistently.

## Booking creation

```text
Booking = PENDING
Vehicle = BOOKED
```

## Driver assignment

```text
Booking = CONFIRMED
Vehicle = BOOKED
Driver = ACTIVE
```

## Trip start

```text
Booking = IN_PROGRESS
Vehicle = ON_TRIP
Driver = ON_TRIP
```

## Trip completion

```text
Booking = COMPLETED
Vehicle = AVAILABLE
Driver = ACTIVE
```

## Owner rejection

```text
Booking = REJECTED
Vehicle = AVAILABLE
```

## Valid cancellation

```text
Booking = CANCELLED
Vehicle = AVAILABLE
```

Do not release Vehicle or Driver prematurely.

